      "text": "Speaking with animation about an interest only to call it \"just a hobby\" puts a qualification immediately after the enthusiasm. Enjoyment can be a reason for an interest to belong in one's self-description before it ever becomes an achievement.",
      "facts": ["C1", "I1"],
      "scenes": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Like transiting Jupiter forming a trine to the natal Sun, the shift is like a wider frame placed around a familiar self-portrait, allowing an existing interest to be included without requiring someone to become a different person. Dropping \"just\" once can leave the interest stated without a ranking of how accomplished or important it is.",
      "facts": ["C1", "I1"],
      "scenes": []
    }
  ]
}
